---
title: Contact
seoDescription: How to reach Hotel Atlantis on Ceintuurbaan, by tram, car, bike or from Schiphol.
---
## From Schiphol

The train from Schiphol to Amsterdam Zuid takes about ten minutes; from there tram 24 runs to De Pijp. Allow half an hour door to door. A taxi takes about twenty-five minutes outside the rush.

## From Amsterdam Centraal

Tram 24 runs from the station straight down through the centre and into De Pijp. Get off at Ceintuurbaan and the hotel is on the corner. It is about twenty minutes.

## By car

We have spaces in our private car park, 350 metres from the hotel, at EUR 27.50 per day and EUR 15 from 1 November to 1 March. Ask reception to hold one when you book. On-street parking in De Pijp is metered and scarce.

## By bike

The city is flat and close together. Reception can arrange hire nearby, and there is somewhere to leave a bike at the door.
